/E (As per the Annual Statistics Report \(2020\) prepared by the Aurat Foundation, over 11,000 cases of violence against were reported in just that year alone. The most common forms of violence were domestic violence \(4,775 cases\); rape and gang rape \(2,297 cases\) and murder / homicide \(1,033 cases\).  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
