<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Domestic violence can adversely affect the family environment, and also affect the self-esteem of children who experience or witness abuse within the family home. They could also grow to be abusive towards their intimate partners in the future. Additionally, their financial well-being may suffer as a victim may be unable to go leave the home after facing an episode of violence at the hands of their abuser; and the number of lost days at work would therefore increase, affecting their overall productivity and opportunities.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
341 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
